{"text": "To target 24 using the numbers 1, 2, 5, and 7 exactly once with the operations +, -, *, and /, we can proceed by trying different combinations of these numbers and operations.", "start": 0, "end": 175, "label": "inform"}
{"text": "Here's one solution:", "start": 176, "end": 196, "label": "inform"}
{"text": "(7 - 5) × (2 + 1) = 2 × 3 = 6", "start": 198, "end": 227, "label": "inform"}
{"text": "But this doesn't get us to 24.", "start": 229, "end": 259, "label": "inform"}
{"text": "Let's try another approach:", "start": 260, "end": 287, "label": "suggest"}
{"text": "(2 + 1) × 7 - 5 = 3 × 7 - 5 = 21 - 5 = 16", "start": 289, "end": 330, "label": "inform"}
{"text": "Still not 24.", "start": 332, "end": 345, "label": "inform"}
{"text": "Let's continue trying:", "start": 346, "end": 368, "label": "suggest"}
{"text": "(2 + 1) × (7 - 5) × 2 = 3 × 2 × 2 = 12", "start": 370, "end": 408, "label": "inform"}
{"text": "Not there yet.", "start": 410, "end": 424, "label": "inform"}
{"text": "Let's try:", "start": 425, "end": 435, "label": "suggest"}
{"text": "(5 + 1) × (7 - 2) = 6 × 5 = 30", "start": 437, "end": 467, "label": "inform"}
{"text": "That's a bit too much.", "start": 469, "end": 491, "label": "inform"}
{"text": "Let's adjust:", "start": 492, "end": 505, "label": "suggest"}
{"text": "(7 - 1) × (5 - 2) = 6 × 3 = 18", "start": 507, "end": 537, "label": "inform"}
{"text": "Not quite, but let's try:", "start": 539, "end": 564, "label": "suggest"}
{"text": "(7 - 1) × 2 + 5 = 6 × 2 + 5 = 12 + 5 = 17", "start": 566, "end": 607, "label": "inform"}
{"text": "Close, but not quite.", "start": 609, "end": 630, "label": "inform"}
{"text": "Let's go for:", "start": 631, "end": 644, "label": "suggest"}
{"text": "(5 + 1) × 2 + 7 = 6 × 2 + 7 = 12 + 7 = 19", "start": 646, "end": 687, "label": "inform"}
{"text": "Still not 24.", "start": 689, "end": 702, "label": "inform"}
{"text": "Let's try one more combination:", "start": 703, "end": 734, "label": "suggest"}
{"text": "(7 + 1) × (5 - 2) = 8 × 3 = 24", "start": 736, "end": 766, "label": "inform"}
{"text": "This works!", "start": 768, "end": 779, "label": "inform"}
{"text": "So, one solution is:", "start": 780, "end": 800, "label": "inform"}
{"text": "(7 + 1) × (5 - 2) = 24", "start": 802, "end": 824, "label": "inform"}
